fixture jump_buffer_control
doc BUILD.md s5 Jump: "Jump buffer 8 f" (control: the same jump and air jump with no buffered press pins the landing frame)
room test/flat
frames 70
input
  0 jump
  10 jump
end
expect
  at 10 event.air_jump=1 air_jumps=0
  mark land 11..69 event.land=1
  at land tick=34 state=ground
end
